This is a brief discussion of key ideas behind the Discontinuous Galerkin (DG) method. 
While we discuss some of the mathematics behind DG, the focus
of this text is informal (from a maths point of view) but puts special emphasis
on how numerical concepts are mapped onto Peano's data structures and mesh 
traversal. 


